<!--
  Every hreflang alternate previously pointed at the same bare URL, which tells
  a search engine nothing: it cannot rank an Arabic page for an Arabic query if
  no distinct Arabic URL exists. index.html now reads ?lang= at boot, so these
  URLs genuinely return different documents and the annotations mean something.

  /embed is intentionally absent: it is the same application in a stripped
  chrome, so listing it would compete with the canonical page for its own
  keywords.
-->
